        The bug was caused by improper handling of the breadcrumbs IRQ during the reset process, which led to incomplete requests and potential instability in the graphics driver. The previous implementation did not adequately manage the cancellation of timers and the state of IRQs, resulting in missed interrupts and incorrect behavior when the engine was reset.

